    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d265">

                <pb facs="0709" n="672" sameAs="frus:frus1951-54IranEd2/pg672"/>

                <head>265. Telegram From the Central Intelligence Agency [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >text not declassified</hi>]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d265-f1"/>
                </head>
                <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                    <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1953-08-16"
                        >August 16, 1953</date>.</dateline>
                <p>DIR 16044. Re: [<hi rendition="#italic">less than 1 line not declassified</hi>]
                        (CIA officer).</p>
                <p>1. Request you report immediately info re: whereabouts Shah, feasibility
                    establishing covert contact; surveillance and protection by Iraq Govt.</p>
                <p>2. Send info copies all messages to STEHE and [<hi rendition="#italic">less than
                        1 line not declassified</hi>] (CIA officer)
                    and use indicator.</p>
                <pb facs="0710" n="673" xml:id="pg673"/>
                <p>3. Above info should be acquired in such a way as <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >not</hi> reveal our intention contact Shah. Security of paramount
                    importance as Iran situation most explosive. Do <hi rendition="#italic">not</hi>
                    make any effort to contact Shah.</p>
                <p>End of message.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
